{"3188360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "True Thief", "steam_appid": 3188360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkness isn’t just a hiding place. It’s a trial.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >848. While the nobility of Orlund drowns in decadence, ordinary citizens scrape by in the filth of the Slums. You are Envent Nocht, a man who has lost everything except the ability to move without a sound. To reclaim your life and alter your destiny, you must infiltrate the city’s most heavily guarded estates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: in Orlund, a thief is only alive until their first mistake.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/6de486b083305ea878041b820d76fed2.poster.avif?t=1788246163\" width=900 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/6de486b083305ea878041b820d76fed2.webm?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/6de486b083305ea878041b820d76fed2.mp4?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Thief, Not an Executioner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget open combat. Your weapons are patience, knowledge of the terrain, and the ability to remain unseen. Each level is a tactical puzzle requiring you to calculate guard routes and seek out alternative paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Art of Lockpicking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door and chest is a barrier between you and your goal. Utilize a unique lockpicking system that demands concentration and finesse. Become a master for whom no lock remains shut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/76b30fef96c603e17c3bb782b7e09b24.poster.avif?t=1788246163\" width=900 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/76b30fef96c603e17c3bb782b7e09b24.webm?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/76b30fef96c603e17c3bb782b7e09b24.mp4?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True Stealth: Zero kills. Complete the game using nothing but your wits and the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Lockpicking: An original lock-manipulation mechanic that turns every heist into a high-stakes challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Shadow with Character: The darkness offers safety, but it harbors hidden threats that can undo a careless thief.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/f7c6394bad75be491733e356726494dc.poster.avif?t=1788246163\" width=900 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/f7c6394bad75be491733e356726494dc.webm?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/f7c6394bad75be491733e356726494dc.mp4?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behind every picked lock lies a dark secret. Behind every secret, someone's life.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Darkness isn’t just a hiding place. It’s a trial.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >848. While the nobility of Orlund drowns in decadence, ordinary citizens scrape by in the filth of the Slums. You are Envent Nocht, a man who has lost everything except the ability to move without a sound. To reclaim your life and alter your destiny, you must infiltrate the city’s most heavily guarded estates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: in Orlund, a thief is only alive until their first mistake.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/6de486b083305ea878041b820d76fed2.poster.avif?t=1788246163\" width=900 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/6de486b083305ea878041b820d76fed2.webm?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/6de486b083305ea878041b820d76fed2.mp4?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Thief, Not an Executioner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget open combat. Your weapons are patience, knowledge of the terrain, and the ability to remain unseen. Each level is a tactical puzzle requiring you to calculate guard routes and seek out alternative paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Art of Lockpicking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door and chest is a barrier between you and your goal. Utilize a unique lockpicking system that demands concentration and finesse. Become a master for whom no lock remains shut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/76b30fef96c603e17c3bb782b7e09b24.poster.avif?t=1788246163\" width=900 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/76b30fef96c603e17c3bb782b7e09b24.webm?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/76b30fef96c603e17c3bb782b7e09b24.mp4?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True Stealth: Zero kills. Complete the game using nothing but your wits and the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Lockpicking: An original lock-manipulation mechanic that turns every heist into a high-stakes challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Shadow with Character: The darkness offers safety, but it harbors hidden threats that can undo a careless thief.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/f7c6394bad75be491733e356726494dc.poster.avif?t=1788246163\" width=900 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/f7c6394bad75be491733e356726494dc.webm?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188360/extras/f7c6394bad75be491733e356726494dc.mp4?t=1788246163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behind every picked lock lies a dark secret. Behind every secret, someone's life.</strong></p>", "short_description": "True Thief is a dark isometric stealth RPG where the shadows are your only ally. In a world mired in corruption, you must become the ultimate thief. No killing—only the mastery of stealth, unique lockpicking mechanics, and secrets that are best left undisturbed.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian<st